第三条:
Article 3  This Law applies to activities processing the personal information of natural persons carried out within the territory of the People’s Republic of China.

This Law also applies to activities carried out outside the territory of the People’s Republic of China processing the personal information of natural persons within that territory, where any of the following circumstances applies:

(1) the purpose is to provide products or services to natural persons within the territory;

(2) the activity analyses or assesses the conduct of natural persons within the territory;

(3) other circumstances provided for by laws or administrative regulations.
